Package: PopGenMapper
Title: Validate Population Ancestry Data for Geographic Visualization
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Pauline", "Owusu-Ansah",
    email = "paulineowusu653@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Checks sample identifiers, ancestry proportions, and geographic
    coordinates before population ancestry visualization. Includes fictional
    example data for learning and development. Geographic plotting is planned
    for a subsequent development milestone.
